;; Morocco (public administrations) public holidays 2003-2040: external gold for MA.
;; Regenerate: uv run --no-project --with holidays==0.109 python -I scripts/generate_mena_holiday_gold.py MA
;; :days lists every holiday as (YEAR MONTH DAY NAME); any other day is not one.
(
 :country "MA"
 :generated "2026-11-28"
 :from 2003 :to 2040
 :note "LOWER CONFIDENCE. Jours fériés of the Moroccan public administrations: décret 2-77-169 as amended (2-00-166: Fête du Trône 30 July, Fête de la Jeunesse 21 August; 2-23-688: Nouvel an amazigh 14 January from 2024; 2-25-1140: Fête de l'Unité 31 October from 2026), Aïd al-Fitr, Aïd al-Adha and Mawlid 2 days each, 1 Muharram 1 day, at the dates of the Habous ministry's moon-sighting communiqués 2003-2026 as the press reported them (habous.gov.ma, MAP and the Bulletin officiel were unreachable), cross-checked with ICOP. 2027-2040 are provisional: the fixed days and tabular estimates."
 :confidence :secondary
 :weekends ((nil 6 7))
 :sources
 (
  (:title "Décret n° 2-77-169 du 9 rabii I 1397 (28 février 1977) fixant la liste des jours fériés chômés dans les administrations publiques, établissements publics et services concédés" :uri "https://mmsp.gov.ma/fr/nos-metiers/horaires-de-travail-et-jours-f%C3%A9ri%C3%A9s"
   :text "Base list for public administrations (the list this calendar follows). As amended (MMSP table, 2024+): 1 Moharram 1 day; Aïd Al Mawlid (12 Rabii I) 2 days; Aïd Al Fitr (1 Chawal) 2 days; Aïd Al Adha (10 Dhu al-hijja) 2 days; 1 Jan; 11 Jan (Manifeste de l'Indépendance); 14 Jan (Nouvel an amazigh, from 2024); 1 May; 30 Jul (Fête du Trône); 14 Aug (Allégeance Oued Eddahab); 20 Aug (Révolution du Roi et du Peuple); 21 Aug (Fête de la Jeunesse); 6 Nov (Marche verte); 18 Nov (Indépendance) = 17 days; 31 Oct (Fête de l'Unité) added from 2026 by décret 2-25-1140.")
  (:title "مرسوم رقم 2.23.688 صادر في 21 من جمادى الأولى 1445 (5 ديسمبر 2023) بتغيير وتتميم المرسوم رقم 2.77.169 (Décret n° 2-23-688 du 5 décembre 2023)" :uri "https://mmsp.gov.ma/sites/default/files/publications/Decret_N_2-23-688_20122023.pdf"
   :text "Adds 'رأس السنة الأمازيغية (14 يناير)' to the list for all civil servants, after 11 January; rest unchanged. Adopted in Conseil de gouvernement 23 Nov 2023.")
  (:title "Statement by the Royal Office: His Majesty the King proclaims October 31 'Unity Day' (Aid Al Wahda)" :uri "https://www.maroc.ma/en/news/his-majesty-king-proclaims-october-31-unity-day-statement-royal-office"
   :text "31 October of each year proclaimed a national holiday (Aid Al Wahda), following UNSC resolution 2797/2025. First occurrence as a holiday: 31 Oct 2026 (implemented by décret 2-25-1140).")
  (:title "Décret n° 2-25-1140 du 7 chaabane 1447 (27 janvier 2026) complétant le décret n° 2-77-169 (Fête de l'Unité, 31 octobre)" :uri "https://adala.justice.gov.ma/api/uploads/2026/02/12/%D9%85%D9%80%D8%B1%D8%B3%D9%80%D9%88%D9%85%20%D8%B1%D9%82%D9%80%D9%85%202.77.169%20%D8%A8%D8%AA%D8%AD%D8%AF%D9%8A%D8%AF%20%D9%84%D8%A7%D8%A6%D8%AD%D8%A9%20%D8%A3%D9%8A%D8%A7%D9%85%20%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A7%D8%B9%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%AF%20%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D8%B3%D9%85%D9%88%D8%AD%20%D9%81%D9%8A%D9%87%D8%A7%20%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%B7%D9%84%D8%A9-1770904523864.pdf"
